    "directions": [
      "In a non-stick kadai, add mustard oil, once it's smoky hot, add potatoes and fry them until golden brown or until cooked well.",
      "Transfer it to an absorbent paper and keep it aside.",
      "Add boiled eggs and fry them for a while until golden brown.",
      "Transfer it to an absorbent paper and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In the same kadai, add mustard oil, once it's smoky hot, add bay leaf, dry red chillies, cumin seed and let it splutter well.",
      "Add onions and saute it for a while until golden in color.",
      "Add prepared masala mixture and cook it for 2-3 minutes.",
      "Add tomatoes, fried potatoes, water, green chillies, cover it with the lid and cook for a while until the tomatoes are mushy.",
      "Add water to adjust the consistency, salt to taste, fried eggs and give it a quick boil.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with paratha or steam rice.",
      "In a bowl, add coriander powder, cumin powder, degi red chili powder, turmeric powder, ginger garlic paste, water and give it a good mix.",
      "Keep it aside for further use."
    ],
